[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12422.389, "timestamp": "03:27:02", "text": "不恰当的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12435.429, "timestamp": "03:27:15", "text": "我认为他要加入了。是的，他在这里。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12439.59, "timestamp": "03:27:19", "text": "是的。是的，你说得对。我们走吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12443.11, "timestamp": "03:27:23", "text": "猫来了。猫来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12458.87, "timestamp": "03:27:38", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12462.63, "timestamp": "03:27:42", "text": "我的天啊。什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12472.229, "timestamp": "03:27:52", "text": "[掌声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12475.03, "timestamp": "03:27:55", "text": "垃圾邮件？真是太疯狂了。谁人乐队做了什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12477.429, "timestamp": "03:27:57", "text": "那？他充分利用了这段时间。"}]